This package is a restoration: two Unity Editor tools rebuilt from their shipped
assemblies after the server they validated against was shut down.

It is therefore derived work. Almost every file here was reconstructed from those
assemblies and reproduces the original logic deliberately, down to the bugs -- that
fidelity is the point of a restoration, and it is also why the underlying expression
remains the original author's. We do not hold it and cannot license it, so no
licence is offered over it and none should be assumed.

What this project contributed is real but narrower: the naming, the reorganisation
into a single package, the provenance headers on every file, the decisions about
what to leave out, and the corrections where the decompiler was wrong. Each file
records which of those applies to it.
